    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>28</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Newton&#39;s law of cooling states that&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>K</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is the temperature of the surrounding. From equation (i),</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>K</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mi>K</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Let the temperature of the body after the given time be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>. By Newton&#39;s law of cooling,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>40</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>K</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>40</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>40</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>14</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>)</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>160</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
